  ('english_grammar', 13, 'intermediate', '"It''s too heavy to lift."를 that절로 바꾼 것으로 옳은 것은?', 'multiple_choice', '["It''s so heavy that I can''t lift it.","It''s so heavy that I can lift it.","It''s too heavy that I can''t lift it.","It''s heavy so that I lift it."]'::jsonb, 'It''s so heavy that I can''t lift it.', 'too ~ to는 so ~ that ... can''t 구문으로 바꿀 수 있습니다.'),
